<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Delta Air lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Delta Air lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it reduced its rating on Delta Air Lines Inc to outperform-long term from outperform.</p>
<p>-- said the airline's revenue yield relative to other airlines continues to weaken.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 7/8 to 70 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
